# Kandev PR Fixup

Use `.agents/skills/pr-fixup/SKILL.md` for the workflow. In a user-started
primary session, handle polling and remediation directly in the same
conversation; rerun only the affected task-defined check after a fix.

If runtime network access to GitHub requires approval, surface that gate and stop.
Do not relaunch polling after denial, cancellation, or interruption.
For fork CI authorization, follow the shared skill.
Its helper scripts are at `<worktree>/scripts/...`, not under the skill directory.
